<!--
  The picture beside each kind of remote. In the core, not the window's
  resources, because the page shows them too, and the build with no
  window (RB_BUILD_GUI=OFF) has no window resources at all. Same paths as
  before (:/media/images/remotes_icons/), so nothing that names one changes.
-->
